---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout locale="en" title="Effective Altruism Bogota" currentPage="index">
<!-- Hero -->
<section class="ae-section hero-ed">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow">AE Bogota · MMXXVI</span>
  <h1 class="ae-display">
    Think carefully,<br />
    <span class="ae-em">act with purpose.</span>
  </h1>

  <div class="ae-grid-2 hero-body">
    <p class="ae-subhead">
      We are Bogota's Effective Altruism community. We use evidence and rigorous analysis to find the best ways to help others.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="hero-context">
        Every two weeks we meet at a bookstore in La Candelaria to read a text and discuss it seriously. Anyone with genuine curiosity is welcome.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/en/events/" class="btn btn-primary">Come to our next event</a>
        <a href="/en/about-ea/" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the introduction</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- What is EA? -->
<section class="ae-section">
<div class="container">
  <hr class="ae-rule--strong" />
  <div style="padding-top: 48px;">
    <span class="ae-caption">Philosophy and community</span>
    <div class="ae-grid-2 ae-grid-2--lr" style="margin-top: 24px; align-items: start;">
      <div>
        <h2 class="featured-title">
          What is <span class="ae-em">effective altruism</span>?
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ae-prose">
        <p>
          Effective altruism is a research project that seeks to find the most effective ways to do good, and a practical community that acts on those findings.
        </p>
        <p>
          A global network of people putting these ideas into practice. In Bogota, we are professionals committed to maximizing the positive impact of our careers, donations, and time.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/en/about-ea/" class="ae-link">Read the full introduction &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Four ideas -->
<section class="ae-section">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow ae-eyebrow--mute">Four core ideas</span>
  <h2 class="section-title-ed">
    Four ideas you probably <span class="ae-em">already agree with</span>.
  </h2>
  <p class="ae-subhead" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
    That could mean you're already on board with effective altruism.
  </p>

  <div class="ae-index">
    <div class="ae-index__row">
      <div class="ae-index__head">
        <span class="ae-index__num">I.</span>
        <h4 class="ae-index__title">It's important to help others</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="ae-index__body">When people are in need and we can help them, we should. Even earning 3 million pesos a month after taxes in Colombia makes you richer than 88% of the world's population.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-index__row">
      <div class="ae-index__head">
        <span class="ae-index__num">II.</span>
        <h4 class="ae-index__title">Everyone deserves equal consideration</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="ae-index__body">Everyone has an equal claim to a fulfilling life, regardless of where they live or their circumstances.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-index__row">
      <div class="ae-index__head">
        <span class="ae-index__num">III.</span>
        <h4 class="ae-index__title">Helping more is better than helping less</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="ae-index__body">All else being equal, we should save more lives and make more people happier. If the same resources can improve 20 lives instead of one, it's better to improve 20.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-index__row">
      <div class="ae-index__head">
        <span class="ae-index__num">IV.</span>
        <h4 class="ae-index__title">Our resources are limited</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="ae-index__body">We have a finite amount of money and time. Choosing to spend on one option means not spending it on others. That's why we must think carefully about how we use our resources.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Global impact -->
<section class="ae-section impact-section">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow">What the community has achieved</span>
  <h2 class="section-title-ed">
    Global projects <span class="ae-em">with concrete impact</span>.
  </h2>

  <div class="impact-grid fade-in">
    <a href="https://www.againstmalaria.com/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-amf.jpg" alt="Against Malaria Foundation" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">370M</span>
        <h4>Bed nets funded against malaria</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">Against Malaria Foundation</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.givedirectly.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-gd.jpg" alt="GiveDirectly" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">US$1B+</span>
        <h4>In cash transfers to 2M+ people</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">GiveDirectly</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.charityentrepreneurship.com/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-ce.jpg" alt="Charity Entrepreneurship" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">50+</span>
        <h4>High-impact charities incubated, serving 75M people</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">Charity Entrepreneurship</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://openwingalliance.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-owa.jpg" alt="Open Wing Alliance" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">3,000+</span>
        <h4>Corporate cage-free commitments across 72 countries</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">Open Wing Alliance</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.1daysooner.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-1ds.jpg" alt="1Day Sooner" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">40,000+</span>
        <h4>Volunteers for accelerated clinical trials</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">1Day Sooner</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://80000hours.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-80k.jpg" alt="80,000 Hours" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">3,000+</span>
        <h4>Career changes toward high-impact work</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">80,000 Hours</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Colombia impact -->
<section class="ae-section" style="background: var(--ae-paper); border-top: 1px solid var(--ae-rule-strong); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ae-rule-strong);">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow">Impact in Colombia</span>
  <h2 class="section-title-ed">
    Allied organizations <span class="ae-em">driving concrete change</span>.
  </h2>

  <div class="impact-grid fade-in">
    <a href="https://www.poverty-action.org/country/colombia" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-ipa.jpg" alt="IPA Colombia" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">3M+</span>
        <h4>Households benefited by Ingreso Solidario: expansion approved by Congress based on IPA evidence, with +14pp in financial inclusion.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">IPA Colombia</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://sinergiaanimal.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-sinergia.jpg" alt="Sinergia Animal" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">165 locations</span>
        <h4>Cage-free commitments secured from Crepes &amp; Waffles and Alimentos Colomer, two of Colombia's largest food operators.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">Sinergia Animal</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://fundacionveg.org/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-veg.jpg" alt="Fundacion Veg" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">130+</span>
        <h4>The only vegan certification authority in Colombia and 4 other Latin American countries since 2013.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">Fundacion Veg</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.orcg.info" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-orcg.jpg" alt="ORCG" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">4 countries</span>
        <h4>Advised Colombia and 3 other countries on implementing the OECD Framework for Managing Emerging Critical Risks.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">ORCG</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://actra.ngo/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-actra.jpg" alt="ACTRA" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">1st in LATAM</span>
        <h4>First to scale evidence-based CBT for crime prevention in Latin America.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">ACTRA</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="https://grana-org.lovable.app/" class="impact-card impact-card-light">
      <div class="impact-card-img"><img src="/img/impact-grana.jpg" alt="GRANA" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="impact-card-body">
        <span class="impact-stat">1st in Colombia</span>
        <h4>First to bring evidence-based mental health to Colombian public schools via teachers, under Law 2460 of 2026.</h4>
        <span class="impact-org">GRANA</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Newsletter -->
<section class="section-dark newsletter-section" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
<div class="container">
  <div class="newsletter-inner">
    <h3 style="color: var(--text-light);">
      More ideas on how to make a difference
    </h3>
    <div class="newsletter-form">
      <input type="email" placeholder="you@email.com">
      <a href="#newsletter" class="btn btn-salmon">
        Subscribe
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Ways to help -->
<section class="ae-section">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow ae-eyebrow--mute">Take action</span>
  <h2 class="section-title-ed">
    Find ways to <span class="ae-em">help</span>.
  </h2>
  <p class="ae-subhead" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
    There are many ways to take action: donations, career choices, volunteering, and more.
  </p>

  <div class="ways-cards">
    <a href="https://www.effectivealtruism.org/courses" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-course.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Take a free online course</h5>
      <p>An 8-week program exploring the core ideas of effective altruism with a global community.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.givingwhatwecan.org/best-charities-to-donate-to-2025" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-donate.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Donate to effective charities</h5>
      <p>Make your donation go further by choosing charities with the highest proven impact.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.80000hours.org/" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-career.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Get career guidance</h5>
      <p>You'll spend 80,000 hours on your career. It's one of your best opportunities for impact.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/en/get-involved/" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-join.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Join Effective Altruism Bogota</h5>
      <p>Connect with professionals in Bogota committed to evidence-based impact.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="https://funds.effectivealtruism.org/" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-funding.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Seek funding for a high-impact project</h5>
      <p>EA Funds has awarded over 1,500 grants for high-impact projects around the world.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="https://www.effectivealtruism.org/ea-global" class="way-card">
      <div class="way-card-img"><img src="/img/ways-conference.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h5>Attend a conference</h5>
      <p>EA Global and EAGx feature experts and opportunities to learn more and advance your career.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <a href="/en/get-involved/" class="btn btn-secondary">More ways to take action</a>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Quote -->
<section class="section-dark">
<div class="container">
  <div class="quote-block fade-in">
    <blockquote>
      "It is not easy to escape from poverty, but a sense of possibility and a little bit of well-targeted help can sometimes have surprisingly large effects."
    </blockquote>
    <cite>Prof. Abhijit Banerjee, Nobel Laureate in Economics 2019</cite>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .container { padding: 0 64px; } }

  .hero-ed { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height, 76px) + 48px); }
  .hero-body { margin-top: 56px; align-items: start; }
  .hero-context { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ae-ink-soft); margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }

  .featured-title {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--ae-t-h2); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: var(--ae-h-tracking); margin: 0; text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .section-title-ed {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--ae-t-h1); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: var(--ae-h-tracking);
    max-width: 900px; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
</style>
